# Lockstep planning request: all per-frame inputs of autoware_diffusion_planner.
# Route and vector map are assumed to be received by the planner node via topics
# before the first call (mission_planner / map_loader run as usual).
builtin_interfaces/Time frame_time
nav_msgs/Odometry ego_kinematic_state
geometry_msgs/AccelWithCovarianceStamped ego_acceleration
autoware_perception_msgs/TrackedObjects tracked_objects
autoware_perception_msgs/TrafficLightGroupArray traffic_signals
bool has_traffic_signals
autoware_vehicle_msgs/TurnIndicatorsReport turn_indicators
---
bool success
string message
autoware_planning_msgs/Trajectory trajectory
autoware_vehicle_msgs/TurnIndicatorsCommand turn_indicators_command
